{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>The son of the Canaanite woman.</b> A proof that the wives of the tribes were Aramean, Egyptian, Edomite, and Midianite, and he mentioned this one alone because Shimon acted improperly in taking a Canaanite woman, and on this account he mentioned the death of Er and Onan, because they were sons of a Canaanite woman:"], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 46, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:48:05.685003616Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}